WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.041
Friday morning Sid agreed to take care of the kitten until after school.

2
00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:24.322
"I just have to get through this cooking show," Ben said.

3
00:00:24.342 --> 00:00:26.223
"Then I'll find a home for the kitten."

4
00:00:27.383 --> 00:00:30.504
"That's what you said yesterday," Sid complained.

5
00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:33.346
He pointed to his torn bedsheets.

6
00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.847
"It destroys everything."

7
00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:41.411
"One more day," Ben promised, hurrying off.

8
00:00:45.014 --> 00:00:51.018
At Monster Academy everyone was outside, waiting eagerly for Kids' Kitchen Showdown to start.

9
00:00:54.581 --> 00:00:57.243
"The master chef has arrived!"

10
00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:58.504
a mummy shouted.

11
00:01:04.972 --> 00:01:07.394
Ben grinned as monsters patted him on the back.

12
00:01:08.715 --> 00:01:11.177
Mr. Freaky's noses were wiggling madly.

13
00:01:12.798 --> 00:01:15.401
Sweat dripped down Mayor Hubbletree's forehead.

14
00:01:16.481 --> 00:01:17.843
Both the mayor and Mr.

15
00:01:17.923 --> 00:01:19.744
Freaky reached for their handkerchiefs.

16
00:01:19.764 --> 00:01:22.166
"Please calm down, Mr.

17
00:01:22.206 --> 00:01:24.068
Freaky," Miss Bungle said.

18
00:01:24.088 --> 00:01:25.729
"And you too, Mayor.

19
00:01:26.109 --> 00:01:28.051
Everything will go smoothly."

20
00:01:28.071 --> 00:01:33.535
"It better," the mayor said, scowling at Mr.

21
00:01:33.595 --> 00:01:36.421
Freaky. "This is a big day!"

22
00:01:37.361 --> 00:01:39.902
A van arrived, followed by some cars.

23
00:01:42.864 --> 00:01:47.686
Ben watched as crew members unloaded cameras, lights, and bundles of cords.

24
00:01:49.046 --> 00:01:51.407
Gaby pointed toward three human kids.

25
00:01:52.808 --> 00:01:55.909
"They must be the other contestants."

26
00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.971
Then three adults got out of a limousine.

27
00:02:00.891 --> 00:02:02.792
Mr. Icky walked over to Ben.

28
00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:06.570
"Those are the judges," the teacher said.

29
00:02:10.594 --> 00:02:11.515
Bolton Ramsey.

30
00:02:11.795 --> 00:02:13.616
He owns several restaurants.

31
00:02:14.978 --> 00:02:17.420
And there's Margaret Oh and Rebecca Gold.

32
00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:20.222
They wrote a wonderful cookbook together."

33
00:02:21.283 --> 00:02:23.765
Bolton Ramsey looked up at the school building.

34
00:02:26.768 --> 00:02:28.529
"Good grief," he muttered.

35
00:02:28.549 --> 00:02:31.252
"What is this dark and sinister place?"

36
00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:35.782
"I heard it's where the monsters go to school," Margaret Oh said.

37
00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:38.323
Rebecca Gold said nothing.

38
00:02:38.343 --> 00:02:42.786
"Can I help you carry anything?"

39
00:02:43.366 --> 00:02:45.687
an octopus monster asked a crew member.

40
00:02:45.707 --> 00:02:48.169
"I have plenty of arms!"

41
00:02:48.849 --> 00:02:50.610
She wiggled her arms wildly.

42
00:02:51.411 --> 00:02:53.252
The crew member's face went pale.

43
00:02:54.612 --> 00:02:56.213
Mayor Hubbletree hurried over.

44
00:02:56.233 --> 00:02:57.994
"It's okay, sir!

45
00:02:58.594 --> 00:03:01.216
This, um, creature won't harm you."

46
00:03:03.489 --> 00:03:06.892
He shooed the octopus monster away and turned back to the man.

47
00:03:06.912 --> 00:03:11.315
"Most monsters are actually quite friendly once you get to know them."

48
00:03:12.416 --> 00:03:15.818
"We've only had a few monsters on the show," the man murmured.

49
00:03:20.822 --> 00:03:24.144
Hubbletree." A woman approached and shook the mayor's hand.

50
00:03:24.164 --> 00:03:29.608
"I'm Viv Stryder, the host of Kids' Kitchen Showdown."

51
00:03:31.632 --> 00:03:33.314
She looked around at the monsters.

52
00:03:33.334 --> 00:03:37.337
"Are you sure this place is safe?"

53
00:03:37.357 --> 00:03:41.561
"Absolutely!" Mayor Hubbletree said.

54
00:03:41.581 --> 00:03:43.363
"Nothing will go wrong.

55
00:03:43.763 --> 00:03:44.744
I promise!"

56
00:03:46.045 --> 00:03:47.507
The host narrowed her eyes.

57
00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:53.132
"I wanted to film this episode at the People Place Middle School, but you convinced me to do

58
00:03:53.172 --> 00:03:53.552
it here.

59
00:03:54.773 --> 00:03:57.216
If anything goes wrong, it'll be your fault."

60
00:03:59.912 --> 00:04:04.533
Mayor Hubbletree wiped more sweat from his forehead as everyone headed inside.

61
00:04:06.274 --> 00:04:08.975
The cooking classroom still smelled like hot sauce.

62
00:04:11.175 --> 00:04:13.076
Ben and Waldo glanced at each other.

63
00:04:13.096 --> 00:04:18.677
"It smells weird in here," Viv Stryder said.

64
00:04:18.697 --> 00:04:22.138
"Oh well, let's just get this day over with.

65
00:04:22.858 --> 00:04:24.039
Start setting up, folks!"

66
00:04:24.739 --> 00:04:27.860
Crew members got to work setting up lights and cameras.

67
00:04:29.248 --> 00:04:31.009
"That wall is shaking!"

68
00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.470
Margaret Oh said.

69
00:04:37.234 --> 00:04:38.295
Mr. Freaky said.

70
00:04:38.315 --> 00:04:41.037
"I don't know what—" "It's nothing!"

71
00:04:41.337 --> 00:04:43.599
Mayor Hubbletree interrupted the principal.

72
00:04:43.619 --> 00:04:47.361
"That's just what the walls in a monster school do."

73
00:04:48.882 --> 00:04:50.223
He laughed nervously.

74
00:04:51.084 --> 00:04:52.865
Ben leaned closer to Waldo.

75
00:04:52.885 --> 00:04:56.308
"We obviously didn't clean up all of the hot sauce.

76
00:04:56.888 --> 00:04:59.669
Do you think that's what is causing the wall to shake?"

77
00:05:00.329 --> 00:05:01.329
Waldo shrugged.

78
00:05:01.349 --> 00:05:07.191
"Maybe." Bright light flooded the room.

79
00:05:07.991 --> 00:05:09.131
Cameras rolled.

80
00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:17.454
Ben was so nervous, he barely heard Viv Stryder introduce all the contestants.

81
00:05:19.654 --> 00:05:22.175
The host was still speaking to one of the cameras.

82
00:05:22.195 --> 00:05:26.156
"The first dish for today will be mac and cheese.

83
00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.861
Time starts now!"

84
00:05:30.281 --> 00:05:32.642
Ben hurried into the pantry for ingredients.

85
00:05:32.662 --> 00:05:37.723
"Eww!" one human kid said.

86
00:05:37.743 --> 00:05:40.084
"They have canned slugs here!"

87
00:05:40.104 --> 00:05:41.984
"And worm eyes!"

88
00:05:42.464 --> 00:05:43.365
said another kid.

89
00:05:52.787 --> 00:05:54.488
Ben returned to his workspace.

90
00:05:55.808 --> 00:05:59.831
He put bat claws, leeches, and mud into a food processor.

91
00:06:03.653 --> 00:06:05.655
Then he shredded some moldy cheese.

92
00:06:07.456 --> 00:06:11.599
Once his macaroni was boiled, Ben put everything into a pan.

93
00:06:12.379 --> 00:06:13.760
He slid it into the oven.

94
00:06:16.722 --> 00:06:19.264
He noticed the wall was shaking even more now.

95
00:06:19.284 --> 00:06:23.287
"What is going on with that wall?"

96
00:06:23.607 --> 00:06:24.748
Bolton Ramsey said.

97
00:06:25.384 --> 00:06:26.845
"Is there something alive in there?"

98
00:06:27.726 --> 00:06:30.067
Ben hoped nothing bad was going to happen.

99
00:06:30.968 --> 00:06:36.191
But if something bad was going to happen, he really hoped it wasn't because of the hot sauce.

100
00:06:40.454 --> 00:06:42.995
up!" Viv Stryder called a little while later.

101
00:06:43.015 --> 00:06:46.637
"Ben will present his dish to the judges first."

102
00:06:47.818 --> 00:06:49.099
Ben took a deep breath.

103
00:06:51.668 --> 00:06:55.231
Then he picked up his mac and cheese and floated up to the judges' table.

104
00:06:55.251 --> 00:06:59.213
"You're a g-ghost!"

105
00:07:00.034 --> 00:07:00.955
Margaret Oh said.

106
00:07:01.695 --> 00:07:02.576
Ben grinned.

107
00:07:04.197 --> 00:07:06.198
"Right then," Bolton Ramsey said.

108
00:07:06.218 --> 00:07:12.183
"Let's see your mac and—" The chef stopped talking as Ben placed the pan on the table.

109
00:07:12.203 --> 00:07:15.165
"Good grief!"

110
00:07:15.525 --> 00:07:16.706
Bolton Ramsey cried.

111
00:07:16.726 --> 00:07:19.208
"What's sticking out of the food?"

112
00:07:20.048 --> 00:07:22.973
"It's just some dried lizard tails," Ben said.

113
00:07:22.993 --> 00:07:23.975
"For crunch."

114
00:07:25.136 --> 00:07:26.118
"For crunch?"

115
00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:28.341
Bolton Ramsey shook his head.

116
00:07:28.362 --> 00:07:31.727
"I'm not eating any of this monster's food!"
